# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Chainway vendor SDK.
#
# The U300 manual grants a non-transferable, non-exclusive licence and states
# that no right to copy the licensed program is granted. Redistributing these
# jars -- publicly or otherwise -- would be sublicensing them, so they stay out
# of source control. Run scripts/fetch-vendor-libs.ps1 against your own copy of
# U300.rar to populate them locally.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
bridge/u300-bridge/libs/*.jar
bridge/u300-bridge/native/*
!bridge/u300-bridge/libs/.gitkeep
!bridge/u300-bridge/native/.gitkeep

# The vendor archive itself, and anything extracted from it.
U300.rar
vendor/

